      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version adds a Javadoc comment explaining the test scenario, renames variables to `inputData` and `outputStream` for clarity, adds inline comments explaining the significance of `0x7F`, and splits the expected output string across two lines to make the two-row hex dump structure visually obvious — all without changing any method calls, arguments, or assertions."
    }
